#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:43
#: 1df584fa5d664beaa8e9e17704c1ea3a
msgid ""
"The pilot can manually switch between the source sets using a 3-position "
":ref:`auxiliary switch <common-auxiliary-functions>` configured for \"EKF "
"Pos Source\" (90).  When the switch is pulled low, the primary source set "
"will be used.  Middle position is for the secondary source set and High is "
"for the tiertiary source set.  If the transmitter's channel 8 switch is to "
"be used set:"
msgstr ""
"飞手可以使用配置为 「EKF Pos Source」(90) 的 3 档 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` 手动切换传感器源组。开关拨低时使用主源组，中间位置使用副源组，高位使用第三源组。若使用遥控器的通道 8 开关，请设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:45
#: 4cf604b9cfaf4b5ab14f5544f830624b
msgid ":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 90 (EKF Pos Source)"
msgstr ":ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 90 (EKF Pos Source)"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:47
#: eea233c439094f97bb15b78c42f764bf
msgid ""
":ref:`Lua scripts <common-lua-scripts>` can be used to automatically switch "
"between sources based on information from the sensors (i.e. GPS speed "
"accuracy, rangefinder distance, etc) or \"innovations\" from the EKF "
"(\"innovations\" are a measure of how close the sensor's latest sensor data "
"matches the EKF's estimate)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Lua 脚本 <common-lua-scripts>` 可根据传感器信息（如 GPS 速度精度、测距仪距离等）或 EKF "
"的「新息」（「新息」是传感器最新数据与 EKF 估算值匹配程度的量度）自动切换传感器源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:49
#: 5ea46051c28d46c498cdb66d9bba5ee8
msgid ""
"`ahrs-source.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/ahrs-"
"source.lua>`__ switches between GPS, T265 and optical flow"
msgstr ""
"`ahrs-source.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/ahrs-"
"source.lua>`__ 在 GPS、T265 和光流之间切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:50
#: fc29050bea174a9099f8d327236218ed
msgid ""
"`ahrs-source-gps-optflow.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/ahrs-"
"source-gps-optflow.lua>`__ switches between GPS and optical flow (AP 4.2 and"
" higher)"
msgstr ""
"`ahrs-source-gps-optflow.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/ahrs-"
"source-gps-optflow.lua>`__ 在 GPS 和光流之间切换（AP 4.2 及更高版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:51
#: c1bef8fb76fc46cf877705074a61cdc2
msgid ""
"`ahrs-source-gps-wheelencoders.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/ahrs-"
"source-gps-wheelencoders.lua>`__ switches between GPS and wheel encoders (AP"
" 4.2 and higher)"
msgstr ""
"`ahrs-source-gps-wheelencoders.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/ahrs-"
"source-gps-wheelencoders.lua>`__ 在 GPS 和轮式编码器之间切换（AP 4.2 及更高版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:54
#: dacdad492daa46b793d2183018ee5318
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:56
#: d7a0b009dc994d3bbd779f303155672d
msgid ""
"First perform a bench test, using the auxiliary switch to manually switch "
"between sources."
msgstr "首先在桌面进行测试，使用辅助开关手动切换传感器源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:58
#: 3878d6c0300e496485911b7edeb04cbb
msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station and confirm that after switching sources, text"
" messages appear indicating that the EKF has changed sources.  If using "
"Mission Planner these messages will appear in on the Data screen's Messages "
"tab"
msgstr ""
"连接地面站，确认切换传感器源后出现文字消息，提示 EKF 已更换传感器源。使用 Mission Planner "
"时，这些消息将显示在数据页面的消息选项卡中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:59
#: 5453821ce29942648f7aff70bab0b663
msgid ""
"After changing sources wait 10 seconds to confirm the EKF remains healthy. "
"If using Mission Planner the EKF label on the HUD should remain white"
msgstr "切换传感器源后等待 10 秒，确认 EKF 保持健康状态。使用 Mission Planner 时，HUD 上的 EKF 标签应保持白色。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:60
#: 5359ec5d46234a9a8b8e30ae0998e5ef
msgid ""
"Check the vehicle's horizontal position, altitude and heading using the "
"ground station.  If using GPS with the :ref:`Intel Realsense T265 <common-"
"vio-tracking-camera>` you should notice a jump when switching from the T265 "
"to GPS but not when switching from GPS to T265.  This is because the "
"\"ExternalNav\" position is always updated to match the GPS when the GPS is "
"the primary source set"
msgstr ""
"通过地面站检查飞行器的水平位置、高度和航向。若将 GPS 与 :ref:`Intel Realsense T265 <common-vio-"
"tracking-camera>` 配合使用，从 T265 切换至 GPS 时应会注意到位置跳变，但从 GPS 切换至 T265 "
"时不应出现跳变。这是因为当 GPS 为主传感器源时，「ExternalNav」位置始终与 GPS 同步更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:62
#: 3852762088eb46849c5a58e5b9d658a3
msgid ""
"Next perform a flight test in a safe environment, manually switching between"
" sources.  Be prepared to re-take control in a manual mode such as "
"Stabilize."
msgstr "接下来在安全环境中进行飞行测试，手动切换传感器源。请做好随时以手动模式（如 Stabilize）重新接管飞行的准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:64
#: 01174fa2bd74414c821b750aa446e56d
msgid ""
"If you plan to automatically switch sources, first walk the vehicle between "
"the GPS and Non-GPS environments to confirm it is switching source sets.  "
"Finally perform a flight test in which the vehicle is flown (or driven) at "
"low speeds between the two environments.  As with previous tests be ready to"
" re-take control in a manual mode such as Stabilize."
msgstr ""
"如果计划自动切换传感器源，首先让飞行器在 GPS 和非 GPS "
"区域之间缓慢移动，确认其正确切换传感器源组。最后进行飞行测试，以低速在两种环境之间飞行（或行驶）。与之前测试一样，随时准备以手动模式（如 "
"Stabilize）接管控制。"

