#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-to-gps.rst:75
#: ee2ef8ab12974eb3a36a18f423febe9f
msgid ""
"The XKFS message's SS field shows the active source for each core "
"(0=primary, 1=secondary, 2=tertiary)"
msgstr "XKFS 消息的 SS 字段显示每个核心的激活传感器源（0=主，1=副，2=第三）"

